window.products.push({"id":1144020,"name":"Oncor 4ft Eco-Friendly Smoky Mountain Christmas Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SxE8CoQFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 4ft Eco-Friendly Oncor Smoky Mountain Christmas tree comes as a hook tree and requires branch assembly. Hook trees can support more decorations and are easier to shape branches tip by tip.  All Oncor Recycled Christmas Trees are made of 100% recycled PVC plastic instead of new plastic, thereby reducing the use of fossil fuels in the production process. All of our trees are made from non-toxic PVC with tin-based stabilizers instead of lead.  We use the best quality raw materials and tree parts to give all Oncor trees a minimum 30-year product life in order to make 30 or more joyful Christmases eco-friendly.  Oncor green boxes are made from strong recycled material cardboard so that consumers can continually reuse our boxes to store Oncor trees after Christmas.  We are the only Christmas tree manufacturer to use super glue instead of white glue on every tree branch to prevent tree tips from falling off within 30 years.All Oncor tree trunks are made with a unique technology of paint-coating both sides of the metal pipes to prevent rust for at least 30 years.  Established in 1980, Oncor is one of the world's oldest Christmas tree manufacturers. Our trees have an industry-leading product life of 30 or more years.  As a member of One Percent for the Planet, we commit to donating at least 1% of annual gross sales to 1%FTP-approved non-profit environmental organizations. We accept returns and provide free return shipping within 21 days of receipt or before December 21st, whichever comes first. We do not charge a restocking fee.Let's make Christmas eco-friendly by using Oncor Recycled Christmas Trees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SxE8CoQFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oncor","source_asin":"B0137T7EMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0137T7EMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0137T7EMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
