window.products.push({"id":1144125,"name":"coorack Under Sink Organizers and Storage, 2-Tier Pull Out Cabinet Organizer Kitchen Drawer Organizer, Bathroom Organizer Under Cabinet Organizer Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmDMe-6OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Stainless Steel & ABS Plastic 【Sliding Under Sink Cabinet Organizer】The 2 tier pull out cabinet organizer is designed to be pulled out which is more convenient to use than other normal storage organizers. The bottom slide-out drawer design will make picking and taking more flexible and easier in limited space. There are 4 little hooks to hang stuff off the unit, effectively using the entire space of the cabinet. Modern and simple nordic style design can be matched well with most household style. 【Easy Fast Assemble & High Quality】No Tools and Screw Required & No break the cabinet. Easy assemble the under cabinet storage in 1 minute. Even slim housewife or children can assemble it with our clear assembly manual. Made of quality ABS plastic and 4 sturdy stainless steel tubes, which is good rust prevention and strong bearing capacity. Free-standing, solid build that will not tip over or fall. Quick and easy snap together assembly, easy care. 【Multi-Purpose Storage & Space Saver】Very compact 2 tier sliding under cabinet organizer maximizes vertical space and make full use of the cabinet space, such as kitchen under sink for cleaning supplies, bathroom under sink for toiletries and so on. Ideal for bathroom, kitchen, living room, office and other place. It also can separate from 2 layers to a tray, perfect for holding glasses, plates, bowls, etc. Freed up a ton of room under the sink. 【Upgraded Higher & Larger Size】Don't worry about the spray bottle not going in. We updated our height of bottom shelf based on other brands of under sink organizer, our bottom drawer can hold bottles up to 10.6 inches high. Assembly dimensions is 15.8\"L x 10.2\"W x 14.2\"H, higher and wider, not only suitable for most under-sink cabinets, but also accommodate more of the daily needs of the bathroom or kitchen supplies, makes all bottles and jars more neat and orderly. 【Easy to Clean & Quality Assured】Top tier of the bathroom cabinet organizer adopt to hollow design which has a good draining effect and prevents moldy. Simply wipe the surface with a damp cloth to clean the shelf. The pull out drawer can help you to better clean the dead corners and clean in all directions. Your satisfaction is what drives us to provide the highest quality products. If any problem with our kitchen cabinet organizer, please reach out to us at any time for after-sales services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmDMe-6OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"coorack","source_asin":"B09YSY8NTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YSY8NTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YSY8NTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
