window.products.push({"id":1144293,"name":"GMOEGEFT Scandinavian Christmas Gnome Lights Timer, Swedish Santa Tomte Gnome with Dangling Legs, Set of 2 Nordic Xmas Decoration - 27 x 4.8 Inch (Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lt0PMdnhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WARM LIGHTED GNOME - Gnome couple with lighted body will brighten your home and warm your heart this winter! It is very easy and safe to decorate. 3 ”AAA” batteries are required when you want to light up the gnomes(Gnomes only. Bench and Batteries are not included in the package.) TIMER FUNCTION - There are 2 modes of this gnome light. Turn it “ON” to keep the light up for 6 hours, then it will light off automatically. Or choose “OFF” to light off the gnomes. (NOTE: The \"ON\" switch has \"Timer\" function.) EXQUISITE WORKMANSHIP - Each gnome is handcrafted, carefully sewing with attention and love. There are safety screws on the battery compartments, making them more sturdy and safe to use. ABOUT GNOME - Gnome, which is also called Tomte, or Nisse. It is part of Scandinavian mythology. According to Scandinavian folklore, they usually hide from humans and use magic. They are reputed to safeguard the farmer and his family against any misfortune, especially during the night. The physical appearance of a tomte is considered to be extremely short and elderly with a long beard. SIZE & MATERIAL - 27 inch tall from the feet to top of hat(including the legs), and 4.8 inch wide. The gnomes’ bodies are made by natural faux fur and felt fabric. Their noses are crafted from wool felt and the beards are made of cozy faux fur. The high caps include wires, and you can pose them in any way you like. The plastic bases are weighted, so that they can stand by themselves.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lt0PMdnhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GMOEGEFT","source_asin":"B08F3D2YBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F3D2YBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F3D2YBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
