window.products.push({"id":1144311,"name":"Tempur-Pedic TEMPUR‐Cloud Prima Medium-Soft Mattress, Luxury Cooling Memory Foam Layers, Twin XL, Made in USA, 10 Year Warranty (10237120)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gBHrC6kGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Power your sleep with a TEMPUR-Cloud Prima Mattress, a 10-inch medium-soft mattress from Tempur-Pedic. The TEMPUR-Cloud Collection offers plush softness paired with the adaptive support and pressure relief of TEMPUR material. Sink into a cushiony sleep with extra-plush layers of TEMPUR material on top and a supportive core that adapts to your shape. TEMPUR-Cloud Prima starts with soft comfort and famous TEMPUR bed support to distribute your body weight. The Cloud Prima is covered in a high-loft super-stretch cover with grey upholstered sides. The SmartClimate System is built with an innovative two-layer construction that helps you stay comfortable while sleeping. The fibers in the top cover draw the moisture away while the SmartClimate System treament in the inner cover provides the cool to-the-touch comfort. Constructed from an extra-soft TEMPUR-ES material, the top layer determines the mattress' feel and works with the Support Layer to allow for personalized comfort and support. The Support Layer is formulated from TEMPUR material to provide support for your body and helps distribute body weight evenly across the mattress. The Base supports the TEMPUR material layers above it and is designed to disperse heat from the mattress. Every TEMPUR mattress is designed to work with a firm stable foundation or an adjustable base. Queen measures 80\" L x 60\" W x 10\" H. Backed by a 10-year limited warranty, the TEMPUR-Cloud Prima is a great entry-point into the Tempur-Pedic bed experience. Availible in Twin, Twin XL, Full, Queen, King, California King, and Split California King sizes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gBHrC6kGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tempur-Pedic","source_asin":"B07QFSNGLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QFSNGLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QFSNGLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1144312,"name":"Hammered Copper Water Bottle 32 Oz Extra Large - An Ayurvedic Copper Vessel - Pitcher Sport Fitness Yoga Leak Proof Vessel Yoga Gym Sports Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UFsa4XcvL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","description":"There are many benefits to be enjoyed by storing water in copper vessels before drinking. Ancient ayurvedic medical texts have recommended storing water in copper.At this time when the world is riddled with pollution, our countrymen are using high potency tablets even for minor problems which is spreading poison in their bodies. Our Rishes, saints and even doctors have found a very easy method to deal with such disorders. The best remedy to overcome these problems is to store water in a copper utensil overnight and drink four glasses every morning. After this you can wash your mouth and brush your teeth. It is also advisable not to take tea for at least 45 minutes. Patients, who cannot drink four glasses of water at a time, can start with smaller quantity and increase the quantity gradually. There are no diseases in the world which cannot be cured by this method. It is useful to drink water before sunrise for all including healthy persons. We request everybody to propagate this morning water use to every one whosoever is suffering from any disease. Care Tips: *Clean your copper ware by hand and avoid dishwasher as the detergent can cause oxidation leading to permanent damage. *Use a solution of equal quantities vinegar or lemon juice and salt diluted with some water at such times but don't use it regularly. *Avoid scratchy cleaners like steel wool. *SUPPORT: Questions will be answered within 12 hours Guaranteed Quality Don't be fooled by bottle with similar looks. We guarantee the quality and if the bottle comes with any damage, we will replace it. BEST WARRANTY Are you disappointed with discolorations and dents of your bottle when you open the package? Do you feel cheated when the size, or look are not what you were promised? Then you are in the right place to get premium quality copper bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UFsa4XcvL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kuberenterprisess","source_asin":"B09BRJ7HTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BRJ7HTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BRJ7HTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
