window.products.push({"id":1144336,"name":"Valentines Day Table Runner 72 Inches Long, Buffalo Plaid Heart ​Red Farmhouse Indoor Outdoor Vintage Love Holiday Theme Gathering Dinner Party Decor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JcdJunQHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"If you love the beauty of your table but want to provide some protection to keep the top of it safe from spills, stains, or food, then a table runner is an ideal choice. Table runners are an easy way to protect your table and brighten up any surface in the home, such as a dining or coffee table. Why choose us? 1. Made Of High-Quality Polyester Fabric, our table runner is Durable/Stain-Free/Water Free And It Has Great Craftsmanship-Fully stitched and hemmed 2. with ombre blue Printing, it can work well with any home decor, from farmhouse to modern and ocean hue..with digital printing, it is not easy to fade 3. Easy to Clean: Machine Washable With Cold Water, Gentle Cycle, Tumble Dry Low And Low Iron So what size suits your table? If you want your table decoration to hang down, follow the size chart and pick a runner for the table. Ideally, it should hang at least six inches over each end of your table, but shouldn't hang further than your tablecloth. For example, if your table is 60 inches long, your table runner should be at least 72 inches long, allowing for six inches at either end of the table. Valentine's Day Collection Show your love and affection through your decor this February. We offer an assortment of Valentine's Day themed items to dress your table display. Bring the love to your home with Pillow Covers and String Lights, these are sure to put you in the mood to celebrate! Makes the Perfect Gift These valentines day decorations make great gifts for him, her, friends, college students, housewarming gifts, wedding gifts, Mother's Day","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JcdJunQHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMDCASE","source_asin":"B09LLZSL9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LLZSL9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LLZSL9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
