window.products.push({"id":1144349,"name":"Upanfoo Extra Thick Bath Rug Non Slip Shaggy Chenille Bathroom Mat Machine Washable Water Absorbent Soft Plush Microfiber Bath Rugs (17\" x 24\", Dark P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RvRGsb37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upanfoo Non-Slip Bathroom Rug Shag Shower Mat Machine - Washable Bath Mats Water Absorbent Soft Microfibers, 20\" W x 32\" L, Red The non-slip chenille bath mat composed of 3 layers: fabric layer, middle sponge layer and bottom anti-skid layer; Due to the DOUBLE THICK & EXTRA LONG MICORFIBER, the bath mat has stronger water absorbent feature rather than the normal mats, as well as a nicer look; Because of the anti-skid backing, the bath mat can be place firmly in place. Especially, it is better to place the mat in smooth and dry floor; The Upanfoo bath mat is easy to care, hand wash easily or toss the whole mat into machine in cold water. And then hang to dry or air dry flat will make the rug look like new ones; Just purchase the chenille non-slip bath mat to enjoy the hygienic & comfort life!! Specifications: - Extra thick 1.2” shaggy plush microfiber with durable TPR anti-skid backing  - Size: 20\" W x 32\" L (may be 1-inch error due to the handle cutting), 1 pieces packaged - Strong water absorbent, anti-slip, machine washable and easy to clean - Have a good function of practicability and decorations. Place the rug on bathroom, wash basin or kids room, the rug is also a good choice for pet use Care Instructions: - Wash separately in cold water;  - Use mild detergent, DO NOT bleach  - DO NOT USE DRYER OR HOT WATER - Hang to dry or air dry flat ★Upanfoo Declaration★ Upanfoo, the brand bend to supply the market with home goods with the quality outperform to the relevant high-level competitors. Upanfoo team devotes their zeal to all the good, yearning for the favor of customers worldwide. With dedicated team and relentless inspection, all the goods meet the market will be of higher standard superior to lots of competitors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RvRGsb37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Upanfoo","source_asin":"B07GSWBB3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSWBB3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSWBB3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1144350,"name":"WMF Domus 43-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318DZ0SGTPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This WMF Domus flatware pattern features a handsome, contemporary design manufactured from high-quality 18/10 stainless steel with an overall satin finish. This stylish pattern suggests a modern \"Euro\" look, making it perfect for everyday use or for dressing up the table. This 43-piece set includes 8 knives, dinner forks, salad forks, spoons, and soup spoons, along with two serving spoons and one serving fork. Amazon.com With contemporary curves and an overall satin finish, Domus flatware makes a simple yet eye-catching pattern for everyday use. The flat handles feature blunt ends; the spoons feature oversized ovoid bowls; and the forks, curved heads with short tines. German design company WMF has the flatware constructed in Asia of high-quality 18/10 stainless steel in a lightweight heft that hands of all sizes should find comfortable. Dishwasher-safe, the flatware never needs polishing. This comprehensive set includes five-piece place settings for eight diners, as well as two serving spoons and a serving fork. Each place setting consists of a dinner knife, dinner fork, salad fork, soup spoon, and teaspoon. The three serving utensils are especially modern, with almost triangular bowls and a simple slit in the center of one that creates a \"fork\" effect. These come in handy for serving everything from a tossed salad to mashed potatoes. Individual place settings, a 20-piece set, and a hostess set are available to augment this 43-piece set. --Ann Bieri What's In the Box 8 place settings and 1 serving set. Each place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon. The serving set consists of: 2 serving spoons; 1 serving fork. 43 items total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318DZ0SGTPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WMF","source_asin":"B000CO7UNE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000CO7UNE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000CO7UNE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
