window.products.push({"id":1144364,"name":"Smudging Kit - White Sage Smudge Sticks for Cleansing - Sage Smudge Kit - White Sage and Palo Santo Sticks - Abalone Shell for Smudging - Smudging Fea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZLxSflaWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring great energy to your life. Our smudge kit is featured with every essential tool you need to start smudging. We carefully designed this smudge kit to guarantee that each part of the smudge kit signifies one of the four elements, that, when used, evokes the fifth element, life energy. The beautiful abalone shell represents WATER, the natural herbs represent the EARTH, the Palo Santo sticks represent the FIRE and the smoke waved by the feather represents the AIR. All the positive life energy is available in one product.  This spiritual remedy set is perfect to get rid of bad energy and bring positive vibes to your life by purifying your environment and yourself. All the art of smudging in one purifying kit, our premium 8 pieces smudge set includes: - 1 Abalone Shell with Wood Stand: a beautiful and functional organic abalone shell that has the energy of the ocean contained. The abalone shell will catch the hot cinders that fall away from the smudging stick after it has burnt. It comes with a hand-carved wood stand to display the smudge kit as an ornament when not in use. - 2 White Sage Sticks: 100% natural herbs hand-wrapped using organic materials when burned they will spread a fresh and pleasant aroma. - 1 White Sage Wrapped with Natural Flowers: one premium flower sage stick that is beautiful and has a unique blossom scent. - 2 Palo Santo Sticks: its name translates to \"Holy Wood\" in Spanish, and has been used by saints and shamans alike for centuries. When burned, Palo Santo releases a fragrant smoke which many believe to uplift energy and aid in spiritual purification. Unlike others, the palo santo sticks included in our set are long enough to burn more than once. Light the stick with a candle or a lighter, holding the stick at an angle and letting it burn for 30 seconds to a minute. - 1 Natural Turkey Feather: once burned, you would like to direct","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZLxSflaWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIPFREE","source_asin":"B083S1SQ39","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083S1SQ39","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083S1SQ39","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
