window.products.push({"id":1144505,"name":"Le Creuset Hi-Tech Kitchen Textile 14-Inch Oven Mitt, Caribbean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411ALieRuLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Protect your wrist from baker's burn and other hazards with this extra-long Le Creuset oven mitt. Boasting a length of 14 inches that makes it safe to reach into a hot oven to grab a recessed handle, the mitt is a great fit for busy kitchens where the stove sees constant action. And because of its stylish solid-color sleeve and complementary white glove, it also adds an attractive flair to the room. The mitt is made of 100-percent terry cloth cotton and canvas, with a special nylon barrier between the layers of insulation. The nylon protects a chef's hands from steam, grease, and other cooking perils, while the cotton fabric is heat-resistant and comfortable to the touch. To further safeguard the fabric, Le Creuset added a Teflon coating that repels stains and water. Meanwhile, the mitt's intense color won't fade over time thanks to its colorfast dyes, which endure repeated machine washing and drying. A final bonus springs from the mitt's embedded magnet, which makes storage remarkably easy. Simply stick the mitt to the fridge door, oven handle, or anywhere else within hand's reach while you're cooking. Chefs who prize both form and function can't go wrong with this oven mitt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411ALieRuLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B0014IZGHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0014IZGHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0014IZGHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1144506,"name":"Champagne Flutes, Iridescent Crystal Glass, Holiday Iridescent Champagne Flutes - Set of 4 - 10\" Stemmed Champagne Flute Romantic Toasting Colored Gla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dHwYFw7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Just love the simple lines and muted colors of these champagne flutes. They’ll totally bring the glam of your bar cart way way up. They are a great way to add some color to your party and they are just the right size for a tall glass of champagne! This set of 4 comes in several different colors, all of which are finished with an iridescent texture. This glass set is a unique twist on traditional champagne glasses, and the short stem makes it easy to hold when you're raising your glass in a toast The colored champagne flutes are the perfect addition to any party! With a short stem, these flutes are great for shorter drinks and cocktails. The iridescent glass is stunning and will add a pop of color to any table setting. These glasses can be used for more than just champagne. They're also perfect for water, juice, or even ice cream floats! For the champagne-loving hostess who wants to make a statement, there's nothing quite like these multicolored, Iridescent Champagne Flutes. The color is just right to go with any decorating scheme and they're so versatile: you can use them for juice or water, wine or cocktails. These multicolor tall champagne flutes are the perfect way to celebrate a special event. They are also short stemmed and have a V-Shape to keep your bubbles bubbly! You'll be able to see all the colors in these glasses, so they're great for parties with a lot of guests! These are also great for home use and any occasion that calls for some bubbly! The Tall V-Shaped Iridescent Champagne Flutes colored are the perfect addition to your barware collection. These gorgeous champagne flutes are elegant and functional. The tall, v-shape of these glasses makes them perfect for sipping bubbly or other light wines. They are also great for serving juice or water at parties and other events. The four different colors in this set will add a pop of color to any table setting! Accentuate your home with these tall champagne flutes which are the perfect way to toast, or just to drink your favorite drink in style. The short stem makes it easier for you to hold onto them and sip your champagne without worrying about spilling it all over yourself. Each Glass has a height of 10\" and 2\" diameter at the top and holds 10 ounces. The iridescent pattern is fun & festive. They come in an array of colors so you'll be able to find one that matches the theme of your event perfectly!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dHwYFw7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B0BZ9PGTP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ9PGTP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ9PGTP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
