window.products.push({"id":1144558,"name":"MINCORD Dryer Sheet Holder, Wooden Dispenser with Hinged Lid for Fabric Softener Sheets, Rustic Container Storage Box, Farmhouse Laundry Sheet Dispens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719+h3SXI1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🗳【100% PREMIUM SOLID PINE WOOD】- MINCORD dryer sheet dispenser with lid is made of Premium Solid Pine Wood. It ensures you a long-term durability, Is a lightweight dryer sheet dispenser for daily use. Simply clean the dryer sheet box with a slightly damp cloth and it’s ready to use. Do not wash with water. 🗳【HINGED LID DESIGN WITH GOOD SEALING】- We know the importance of maintaining the scent of drying sheet. Our dryer sheet holder with lid can always keep your dryer sheets fresh. While the lid sits securely, it can keep your dryer sheets smell delightful without losing its smell. The lid also keep your dryer sheet arrange tidy and keep dust and dirt away from your dryer sheet. 🗳【FARMHOUSE STYLE DRYER SHEET HOLDER】- This rustic dryer sheet container features \"Wash-Dry-Fold\" painted farmhouse laundry sign. The black and white color design makes the box look clear, simple and modern, and complements the laundry room decor. This laundry sheet holder is made with lots of love, the rustic look makes it get along well with almost all laundry room styles. 🗳【HIGH CAPACITY STORAGE DESIGN】- EXTERNAL DIMENSIONS - 8 x 5 x 4.2 (inch) // INTERNAL DIMENSIONS - 7.1 x 4.3 x 3.1 (inch) // L x W x H. This well-constructed fabric softener dispenser fits up to 150 standard sized fabric softener sheets, The extra wide opening dryer sheet container make it easy to withdraw fabric dryer sheets. Beautiful exterior design can add a farmhouse vibe to your laundry room decor. 🗳【BEST GIFT CHOICE】- This rustic farmhouse contemporary style dryer sheet storage box is perfect as a gift for family, friends or colleagues. Designed and built from scratch for keeping your laundry sheets fresh and organized. A practical and elegant fabric softener dispenser cover makes your laundry more fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719+h3SXI1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MINCORD","source_asin":"B0BJZBS6QT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZBS6QT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZBS6QT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1144559,"name":"Lodge L12CO3 Cast Iron Camp Dutch Oven, 6 quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bvtxcqofL._AC_SL1441_.jpg","description":"Regarding the chip in the finish of the product: It is a result of seasoning the pan in production. The cookware is hanging as it rides on a conveyer through the seasoning process. As it rides through the seasoning tunnel, an electrostatic sprayer applies a natural vegetable oil seasoning to the pan. As it the pan passes through the seasoning ovens, the seasoning oil can sometimes collect into a small bubble at the lowest point of the pan and as it’s heated in the seasoning ovens, that bubble can develop a baked-like surface. That surface can sometimes flake and reveal a brownish color beneath. The brownish color is not rust but caramelized seasoning baked onto the iron itself and disappears with use. It is inherent in the seasoning process and not a defect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bvtxcqofL._AC_SL1441_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B09HB221WR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HB221WR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HB221WR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
