window.products.push({"id":1144627,"name":"Miller High Life Girl in the Moon Vintage 14 Inch Neon Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LiSF91U0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This officially licensed Neon Wall Clock is the perfect addition to any game room, garage or man cave. This impressive clock has two neon rings; one is an accent colored neon ring on the exterior and the other is a brilliant white neon ring on the interior of the clock to light up your favorite logo. Other highlights include chrome finished resin housing and a high-grade glass clock face cover. The battery-operated quartz clock mechanism will keep it ticking for a long time, while the neon runs off the included AC adapter. The neon is controlled by the pull chain and the back of the clock includes a wall hanging mount and has two modes - solid state and blinking. The 3\" depth of this clock combined with the radiant shimmer of the neon reflecting off the chrome housing is sure to make this clock pop on any wall! IMPORTANT: Avoid buying counterfeit products and transacting with unauthorized sellers. Look for the officially licensed decal on every one of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LiSF91U0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Gameroom","source_asin":"B003WJTOB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003WJTOB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003WJTOB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1144628,"name":"BLUDRO White LED String Lights Power Adapter, 66Ft 200 LED Decorative Lights for Indoor Outdoor Party Wedding Birthday Christmas Thanksgiving Holiday ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jwBNOGX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The LED Starry String Lights are made with a fine bendable copper wire that can conform to any shape to add a beautiful decorative accent. Flexible yet durable, the string lights are perfect for positioning lights to curtain, any decorative or holiday project. The white LED is individually mounted along the string and provide an elegant sparkling glow that can be seen from any angle.  BLUDRO LED white STAR LIGHTS Create a magical lighting experience for your home, party or business. Christmas, New Year's and birthday parties will glow with creativity when you include these bendable and flexible lights to your décor. Wrap them around plants or patio furniture in your garden, or even around and behind artwork in your home. Decorate your cubicle at work or use it to impress visitors to your restaurant or shop. Crafted from high-quality copper, the set is designed to be used both indoors and outdoors without worry. 4.9 feet adapter cord + 66 feet of lighting wire with 200 individual LEDs, this makes the star light less intense and more pleasant for the eyes. You’ll be able to make any occasion or space extra special with these bright starry night twinkle fairy lights. The lights also can be great for wedding, dinner parties, girl’s night in, bedroom and more! They create amazing atmosphere during Easter and Christmas holidays. The lights are also defined Fairy Lights.BLUDRO stands behind all of its products 100%. These lights come with a 12-month warranty if you are not completely satisfied. Notice: 1. Do not apply excessive force or repetitively bend the same spot; 2. The string light could not be extended or connected with other string lights; 3. The strings are waterproof (IP66 Grade) and can fully submersible in water, however the power adapter and plugs (include USB) is not. The plug can be used outdoors in a covered area or in a waterproof electrical box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jwBNOGX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLUDRO","source_asin":"B07GYRRR7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GYRRR7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GYRRR7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
