window.products.push({"id":1144810,"name":"Kilner Square Swing Top Glass Jar | 2L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BTo8oPkKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Kilner Square Glass Clip Top Jar with Rubber Seal and Stainless Steel Clip, 2 Litre - Additional Key Product Features: 1) Unlike plastic, Kilner jars don’t absorb flavours and odours. 2) Can be easily sterilised in order to maximise hygiene. 3) Jar features the iconic Kilner logo on the front - a sign of quality since 1842. NOTE: WASH BEFORE FIRST USE AND DO NOT POUR BOILING WATER DIRECTLY INTO THE JAR. About Kilner - ‘the Original and Best’ Since 1842 Founded by John Kilner in England in 1842 - and initially manufacturing a range of glass bottles and jars - the very first ‘Kilner Jar’ was invented towards the end of the 19th century.  Still as successful to this day as it was when originally brought to market, the long-lasting popularity of Kilner products is due to their iconic design, distinctive pressure seal and overall quality.  Trusted by households all over the world to preserve and pickle their fruit and vegetables, as well as offering the well-publicised health benefits of storing food and drink in glass rather than plastic, Kilner has become an everyday essential in the modern-day kitchen and beyond.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BTo8oPkKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kilner","source_asin":"B00E1HIJ8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E1HIJ8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E1HIJ8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1144811,"name":"U Chef Internal Meat Thermometer and Digital Timer for Oven, BBQ, Grilling and Smoker, Fahrenheit Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s7leEYhOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make a perfect meal with UChef Feel the chef’s magic in your hands - Do you want to achieve a perfect doneness for your beef? - Are you tired to overcook your food? - Are you afraid of making everyone sick with an under - cook chicken or turkey? The new \"U Chef\" Oven & BBQ Digital Thermometer will help you out. The U Chef is designed to measure the internal temperature of every Meat, Fish and Poultry so you can achieve with no previous experience a perfect and healthy meal at the style you like the most: Rare, Medium Rare, Medium, and Well Done. ♥ Large & Smart Touch Screen with Easy Select Preset Temperatures for All Meats Fish and Poultry. ♥\"Custom programming\" mode: set your own specific temperature to suit your personal preferences. ♥ Fahrenheit is set as default. Change to Celsius on the touchscreen. ♥ Loud & Clear Alarm. Know when your food is ready. ♥ Free eBook: Best World's BBQ and Roasting recipes. ♥ Cooking &Timer options. Switch on the back of thermometer. ♥ Accurate Stainless Steel Probe. Can handle up to 490 Fahrenheit. ♥ The braided wire connection is flexible and overall length 48\", long enough to reach from the meat out the oven/smoker or grill. ♥ For use in stove, oven, grill, bbq, boiling water or even to make candy. Anywhere that accurate temperature control is required ♥ Includes a foldable stand and two magnets on the back to place it wherever you need it The U Chef's manufacturer offers a lifetime guarantee & 100% complete satisfaction. Simply contact the manufacturer for a complete no-hassle refund if you need it. Detailed Operating Instructions Manual and Video included. Amazon Buyers Love and Trust our U Chef Brand to be Quality & Premium Products. We Cannot Guarantee this \"Limited Edition\" Special Price! Please get yours now. - Requires 2 AAA Batteries, (Not Included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s7leEYhOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U Chef","source_asin":"B01CDQ2222","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CDQ2222","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CDQ2222","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
