window.products.push({"id":1144829,"name":"Govee Smart WiFi Humidifiers for Bedroom, Top Fill Cool Mist Humidifiers for Baby and Plants, Work with Alexa, Auto Humidity Adjustment, 24 dB Super Q","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VHQkmoSDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smart App Control: First, upgrade the app to the newest version 5.0.2. Using the App to adjust the auto mode, custom mode, display off, timers, schedules, mist levels, safety lock. Work with Alexa, Google Assistant, or IFTTT for voice control. Top-Fill Design: Easy to refill water and clean. The smart humidifiers for bedroom have an water tank design to easily pour water in and out. Please don't add water via the mist outlet and don't drop essential oils directly into the humidifier. Auto Mode: The smart humidifier will turn off at your target humidity, and it will turn back on by itself when it drops below 3% then the target humidity level. Must connect to a Govee Thermometer Hygrometer to use this function (sold separately) Higher Mist Height: The highest mist height up to 31.5in. The higher mist stays in the air for a longer period of time without getting your desks and floors wet. Eight mist levels output adjustment, features a high mist output up to 7oz per hour. Supported Govee Thermo-Hygrometer Models: H5051/H5052/H5071/H5072/H5074/H5174/H5179/H5075/H5101/H5102/H5177/H5100/B5178/H5106.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VHQkmoSDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Govee","source_asin":"B098PBQP1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098PBQP1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098PBQP1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1144830,"name":"TanNicoor Sage Green Boho Comforter Set King(104x90Inch),All Season 3-Piece(Pom Poms Fringe Comforter+2 Pillowcases),Soft Microfiber Filled Bedding, L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v6agkSNbS._AC_SL1201_.jpg","description":"【Chic Pom Pom Fringe Comforter】TanNicoor sage green comforter set adopt boho style and cute handmade ball fringe designs,Touch and texture are extremely comfortable. Compared with other normal comforters, our sage comforter not only makes the whole bedding look more charm and stylish, and also can eadd an extra layer of art style to match your room décor. Taking our pom pom comforter home will add vibrancy to your bedroom. 【Cozy Material & Light Fluffy】Our boho comforter set is made of premium quality 100% brushed microfiber fabric with soft microfiber inner fill.Which is ultra softness and comfortable, it is lighter than you would expect and will not put too much pressure on your body. Using it is like being wrapped in a cloud. breathable, and suitable for all seasons use. Laying in this cozy comforter, you can enjoy a night of sound sleep. 【3 Pieces Green Comforter Set】TanNicoor King comforter set includes:1 pom pom fringe comforter (104x90Inch), 2 pillowcases (20×36Inch);the pillow shams adopt the same pom trim stitched design.Adopts unique microfiber filling technology and stitching craftsmanship keeps the comforter's filling in place and distributed evenly,Prevent the filling from moving around or clumping together. Always keep the comforter lightweight and fluffy. 【Aesthetic Design & All Seasons】TanNicoor sage green king comforter set’s weight is ideal for year-round use. Our pom comforter set keep you warm in the winter and fit to use in the summer. Comforter is solid colors and pom pom fringe trim stitched, The cute pom poms are securely attached to the comforter and will not fall off easily. Add a hint of elegance to any color scheme or aesthetic. Perfect as a great gift idea for men and women at special festival. 【Easy Care & Warm Tips】To clean the sage green comforter :Machine wash separately on cold water with similar colors, and simply sun-dry or tumble dry on a low heat setting.Do not iron. Do not dry clean.Do not bleach to keep the color vibrant.Warm Tips:Our shabby chic bedding comforter set is packed in a vacuum bag ,it might be some wrinkles when you get our comforter set, just shake and pat it gently until it becomes fluffy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v6agkSNbS._AC_SL1201_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TanNicoor","source_asin":"B095RN45MS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095RN45MS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095RN45MS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
