window.products.push({"id":1144868,"name":"TOKYO MATCHA SELECTION - Nanbu Tetsubin : Umahada (horse's skin) 0.8 Liter - Japanese cast iron teapot kettle from Iwate Japan [Standard ship by EMS: ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715I8DuLDYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[How to take care of Tetsubin iron tea kettles]  Please follow the instruction below to maintain Tetsubin iron tea kettles.  1) Keep using it  2) Remove moisture completely after use - Do not leave water in it. - After use, you can put it over a fire to let it dry (Do not heat a kettle with no water in it.) *It will be a cause of a fire. - It's also OK to remove wetness of inside of the kettle with a dryer.  3) You can keep using it to build Yuaka (water-formed deposits).  4) If you don't use it for a long time, you can sun drying once in a while.   Especially  *3) if a kettle has 'Yuaka', a hot water would be more tasty and a kettle won't become rusty. This 'develop an iron kettle' would simply be one of the real charm of iron kettle.       [PRODUCT INFO]  - capacity: 0.8 Liter - OK for Direct Fire - This is the original iron kettle. You can put the iron kettle itself over the fire and boil the water. - You can use it as a regular pot as well. - The inside is not enamel processed. - It doesn't come with a stainless net.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715I8DuLDYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tokyo Matcha Selection","source_asin":"B00PCKZIUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PCKZIUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PCKZIUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
