window.products.push({"id":1144903,"name":"Precious Zara Breathes and has a Heartbeat - So Truly Real Lifelike, Interactive & Realistic Baby Monkey Doll 16-inches by The Ashton-Drake Galleries","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wfG77bWgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Babies are meant to be cuddled, and infant orangutans are no exception. Just like human babies, they love to be held, and we certainly love to hold them. Especially when they look at you with adorably playful expressions, they simply steal your heart! Now, you can bring home Precious Zara, a darling baby monkey doll created by renowned artist Jane Baffi and the first-ever breathing monkey doll with a heartbeat from The Ashton-Drake Galleries. This So Truly Real monkey doll is meticulously handcrafted and weighted to feel like you're cradling an actual newborn monkey. Her RealTouch vinyl skin feels incredibly lifelike while her expressive brown eyes, soft wisps of hand-applied hair and gentle hand-painted features add more realism. Plus, she arrives in a tropical one piece printed with bananas, palm trees and monkeys, along with a matching rosette-trimmed headband. Best of all, you can feel Zara's little heart \"beating\" and feel her chest slowly moving up and down as she \"breathes.\" Strong demand is expected, so order now! Premiere issue in the Baby, You Melt My Heart Monkey Doll Collection Requires batteries (not included) Certificate of Authenticity Measures 16\" L; 40.6 cm L","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wfG77bWgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Ashton-Drake Galleries","source_asin":"B00L8BOO1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L8BOO1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L8BOO1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
