window.products.push({"id":1144986,"name":"Swamp Bucket Seafood Boiler With Black or Red Lid (Lid Color Will Vary Depending on Inventory Supply) White & Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":127.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KWj+mNSYL._AC_SL1222_.jpg","description":"Do you ever want to boil a small batch of seafood for a few people but dread hauling out the propane tank and equipment? Or do you hate the smell in your home from boiling on the stove? Then you need a Swamp Bucket! A food grade HDPE electric boiling bucket made for smaller batches of seafood (shrimp, blue crabs, snow crab legs, etc. with all the fixings - even turkey necks, peanuts, sausage - anything really!). All you need to do is add water, plug it in, and watch it begin to boil in about 15 minutes. After finishing your boil, the lid has small holes for draining off the water. Now you can carefully unscrew the lid and pour out your seafood and ENJOY! Clean up is just as easy. Simply allow the bucket to cool then use the water hose to rinse out. Now you can put it away to use over and over again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KWj+mNSYL._AC_SL1222_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B9HW44HN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9HW44HN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9HW44HN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1144987,"name":"Lafer Recliners Kiri Recliner Ice Leather Swivel Recliner Chairs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IcXICLiwL._AC_.jpg","description":"Kiri Recliner Chair by Lafer Recliners of Brazil is an ergonomic swivel recliner chair. Modern Lafer Kiri Recliner is a modern leather recliner chair and swivel reclining lounge chair for home, condo, office, yacht or RV. Kiri Recliner Dimensions: Total Height 41\", seat height 19\", total width 29\", width between arms 20\", depth upright 31\", depth reclined 67\". Kiri Recliner by Lafer Leather Recliners comes with top grain leather and a fully retractable footrest that tucks under the seat when closed. No need for footstools. Modern swivel recliner goes from upright to a full sleep position, or lock at any angle in between with a simple turn of the knob. Leather recliner armrests lower with the backrest movement for comfortable sleeping. Non-sliding base swivels 360 degrees. Every Lafer ergonomic recliner chair features independent backrest, headrest and footrest controls. Recline back to 170 degrees to a full sleep position. Headrest adjusts for TV watching or for sleep. The fully adaptable adjustment systems of the Lafer modern recliners have been developed by Percival Lafer over the past 20 years to provide the best experience the comfort of a swivel recliner chair can offer you, whether in an active position, such as talking, reading, watching TV or working with a laptop, or in a position of pure relaxation, rest or sleep. Small footprint allows this chair to go in small spaces and still have ample room. Lafer Recliners are ergonomic recliners and lounge chairs for Home, Condo, Yacht or Office. With a Lafer recliner, the whole body remains in the correct position for total relaxation. A true one size fits all recliner, owned by thousands of users worldwide. Lafer Recliners come with top grain leather. Strict quality control of Lafer recliners ensures tasteful furniture, made with high quality materials and finishes to last a lifetime. A Lafer recliner is an investment in quality, style and comfort! Many colors in stock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IcXICLiwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lafer Recliners","source_asin":"B01M62KKAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1144987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M62KKAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M62KKAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
